+# Vercel AI SDK runtime guidance
+
+`/src/support-agent.ts` passes an indirectly built request object to `generateText`, and that object's `prepareStep` callback may replace instructions. Static repository inspection cannot establish this as a supported direct boundary. Preserve the integration unless it is deliberately migrated; the concrete resolution is to load the instruction before the call and pass it as `instructions` on the object literal supplied directly to `generateText`, with focused runtime coverage for that invocation.
